          "stage2_correction": {
            "pair": "አንከሰ -> እንከሰ",
            "reason": "Classical Ge'ez inferential particle እንከሰ ('therefore then') in the patristic citation 'እንከሰ ግዑዝ ውእቱ ወልድ' begins with 6th-order እ, not 1st-order አ."
