            "pair": "ምን -> ንጐ",
            "reason": "Canonical Ge'ez Matthew 17:27 reads 'ወባሕቱ ከመ ኢያንጐርጕሩ' ('lest they murmur/be offended'); the labiovelar ንጐ was misread as ምን due to ink bleed."
